}

Midpoint -> Backward: "Incorrect\n/ Slow" {
  style.stroke: "#B53333"
}

Backward: Move backward\nfoundational {
  style: {
    font-color: "#141413"
  }
}

Forward -> Check
Backward -> Check

Check: 3 consecutive\ncorrect? {
